<h2>Death 2</h2>
<i>"What is death but a freedom or the soul?"<br>
--Unknown</i>
<p>Again you have failed. Again you have let down the fury of <?{vn_windall}>Wind</?><?!{vn_windall}>Rain</?>. Purely for the pleasure of the furies, you must fight for your right to live again, using only ~gtrees~. and ~ysun cannons~.
This mission should take about 5 mins max.-It's ridiculously simple



